WEBVTT

00:00.609 --> 00:03.900
Meet Mluva. The most delightful dictation
app for

00:03.910 --> 00:04.629
Omarchy.

00:05.719 --> 00:07.480
A tiny presence on your desktop.

00:07.859 --> 00:10.360
Speak, and your words stay right with you.

00:10.839 --> 00:13.239
Open the workspace. Keep the thought going.

00:15.409 --> 00:17.799
Live rewrite turns a rough idea into a

00:17.809 --> 00:19.330
clear draft, as you speak.

00:19.669 --> 00:21.229
Both sides stay steady.

00:21.469 --> 00:23.229
Your original stays yours.

00:24.509 --> 00:25.029
Copy it.

00:27.389 --> 00:27.969
Polish it.

00:29.899 --> 00:30.560
Rewrite it.

00:32.390 --> 00:33.599
Make the final edit,

00:33.609 --> 00:35.919
and save. Your notes are ready when you

00:35.929 --> 00:36.529
return.

00:37.369 --> 00:39.879
Control P puts the next action under your

00:39.889 --> 00:40.430
fingers.

00:42.389 --> 00:44.409
And when Omarchy changes its theme,

00:44.550 --> 00:45.589
Mluva follows.

00:50.389 --> 00:52.289
Quiet design. Clear words.

00:52.489 --> 00:53.510
A little more delight,

00:53.649 --> 00:54.289
every day.
